<% if @test_mode %>
TEST MODE: this message was redirected to the site test address.

<% end %>
Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.username.presence || 'there' %>,

<% if @notice == 'added' %>
<% if @actor_label.present? %>
<%= @actor_label %> added you as a host of <%= @event.title %>.
<% else %>
You were added as a host of <%= @event.title %>.
<% end %>
You'll be emailed if this event is cancelled, postponed, or its date or time changes.
<% elsif @notice == 'removed' %>
<% if @actor_label.present? %>
<%= @actor_label %> removed you as a host of <%= @event.title %>.
<% else %>
You were removed as a host of <%= @event.title %>.
<% end %>
<% elsif @notice == 'cancelled' %>
<%= @event.title %><% if @occurrence %> on <%= @occurrence.occurs_at.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %><% end %> was cancelled<% if @reason.present? %>: <%= @reason %><% end %>.
<% if @occurrence && @event.recurring? %>
Other dates of this event are unchanged.
<% end %>
<% elsif @notice == 'postponed' %>
<%= @event.title %><% if @occurrence %> on <%= @occurrence.occurs_at.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %><% end %> was postponed<% if @until_time %> until <%= @until_time.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %><% end %><% if @reason.present? %>: <%= @reason %><% end %>.
<% elsif @notice == 'relocated' %>
<%= @event.title %> on <%= @occurrence.occurs_at.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %> has moved to <%= @location %><% if @reason.present? %>: <%= @reason %><% end %>.
<% elsif @notice == 'rescheduled' %>
<% if @schedule_only %>
The repeating schedule for <%= @event.title %> changed. Anyone RSVPed to a date that moved or was removed has been emailed.
<% elsif @occurrence %>
<%= @event.title %> has a new time.
<% if @start_changed %>
It was <%= @previous_start.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %>.
<% end %>
It is now <%= @occurrence.occurs_at.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %> to <%= (@occurrence.occurs_at + @occurrence.duration.minutes).strftime('%I:%M %p') %>.
<% if @duration_changed %>
It used to last <%= @previous_duration %> minutes.
<% end %>
<% else %>
The schedule for <%= @event.title %> was updated.
<% if @start_changed %>
It now starts <%= @event.start_time.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %>. It was <%= @previous_start.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %>.
<% end %>
<% if @duration_changed %>
It now lasts <%= @event.duration %> minutes. It was <%= @previous_duration %> minutes.
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

View the event:
<%= @url %>
